// A freelance designer's books: tax year 2025, plus January 2026 for the fourth
// estimated payment and the invoices still open.
//
// The folders are constraints: journal/2025/02.ax holds February 2025 only.

base USD

use std
use us
use us/ira

/// Me: a brand designer working alone, single, born in 1989. The `lives us` line
/// puts federal income tax in force. Self-employment tax is not in any shipped
/// system, so tax.ax writes it as project laws.
entity me : person
  born   1989-09-03
  filing single
  lives  us
